    "1bd8af3d7e79377532e7f37c4f9d3c3cce08430d489b11efac3f015031c45113": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "8371a2b444fd2d287db7a4d35113b7961a15cd59cd4ab4c56553668efe80d3d4",
      "contextFingerprint": "41ab6b7a0431cf9d071779ae9700b6f7b3adfdeb8f06b1e66702396865ec2f6a",
      "sourceText": "**当前use_scan_matching=False、do_loop_closing=False。** 从空地图进行常规建图时，Karto仍接收扫描并形成栅格，但跳过扫描匹配，也不把新扫描加入位姿图；因此不会通过自动闭环调用Ceres修正轨迹。这里的图主要依靠上游里程计摆放扫描，长距离、转弯后的累计误差不能指望这组求解器设置自动消除。[当前处理路径（Mapper.cpp，2.6.10）](https://github.com/SteveMacenski/slam_toolbox/blob/2.6.10/lib/karto_sdk/src/Mapper.cpp)",
      "translatedText": "**Currently use_scan_matching=False, do_loop_closing=False\\.** When performing regular mapping from an empty map, Karto still receives scans and forms a grid, but skips scan matching and does not add new scans to the pose graph; therefore, it will not call Ceres through automatic loop closure to correct the trajectory\\. The graph here mainly relies on upstream odometry to place scans, and accumulated errors after long distances and turns cannot be expected to be automatically eliminated by this set of solver settings\\.[Current processing path (Mapper.cpp, 2\\.6\\.10)](https://github.com/SteveMacenski/slam_toolbox/blob/2.6.10/lib/karto_sdk/src/Mapper.cpp)",
